WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.950
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.220 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.210 --> 01:51.030
[Episode 6]

4
02:06.430 --> 02:07.930
Thanks... Thank you.

5
02:23.360 --> 02:24.290
Well, this is...

6
02:26.370 --> 02:27.370
From the company.

7
02:29.120 --> 02:29.910
Thank you.

8
02:39.020 --> 02:40.250
I was starving,

9
02:40.250 --> 02:41.810
so I ate another portion.

10
02:48.360 --> 02:50.150
Did I take his portion?

11
02:55.780 --> 02:57.970
I'm also quite hungry today.

12
03:00.650 --> 03:02.580
W-Well, then, you should eat more.

13
03:33.370 --> 03:34.120
Since you're done,

14
03:34.120 --> 03:36.320
I'll throw your wrapper away with mine.

15
04:06.960 --> 04:08.770
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

16
04:08.800 --> 04:11.800
♪ Telling me to bravely follow my heart ♪

17
04:14.060 --> 04:16.510
♪ Until you came along ♪

18
04:16.540 --> 04:20.170
♪ And made my heart skip a beat ♪

19
04:22.000 --> 04:24.310
♪ Not much has to be said ♪

20
04:24.340 --> 04:27.660
♪ One look is all it takes ♪

21
04:29.210 --> 04:31.210
♪ That distant silhouette ♪

22
04:31.230 --> 04:35.490
♪ Became crystal clear in this moment ♪

23
04:37.680 --> 04:39.270
♪ It's you ♪

24
04:39.290 --> 04:41.590
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

25
04:41.620 --> 04:43.140
♪ Just you ♪

26
04:43.170 --> 04:45.530
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

27
04:45.560 --> 04:46.940
♪ This moon tonight ♪

28
04:46.960 --> 04:49.200
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

29
04:49.220 --> 04:52.520
♪ And keeps me company through the endless night ♪

30
04:52.970 --> 04:54.640
♪ It's you ♪

31
04:54.670 --> 04:56.830
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

32
04:56.870 --> 04:57.890
♪ Just you ♪

33
04:58.170 --> 05:00.510
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

34
05:00.550 --> 05:01.960
♪ By your side ♪

35
05:01.990 --> 05:03.060
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

36
05:03.090 --> 05:05.440
♪ Feel warm again ♪

37
05:06.490 --> 05:08.890
♪ It's you ♪

38
05:12.770 --> 05:13.430
Thanks.

39
05:22.930 --> 05:23.990
Put this on to avoid

40
05:24.060 --> 05:24.990
catching a cold.

41
05:25.600 --> 05:27.190
♪ It's you ♪

42
05:27.210 --> 05:29.520
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

43
05:29.300 --> 05:30.430
Let me dry you, too.

44
05:29.540 --> 05:31.060
♪ Just you ♪

45
05:31.090 --> 05:33.450
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

46
05:33.480 --> 05:34.860
♪ This moon tonight ♪

47
05:34.880 --> 05:37.120
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

48
05:37.140 --> 05:40.450
♪ And keeps me company through the endless night ♪

49
05:40.890 --> 05:42.560
♪ It's you ♪

50
05:42.590 --> 05:44.750
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

51
05:43.900 --> 05:44.930
I'll do it myself.

52
05:44.790 --> 05:45.810
♪ Just you ♪

53
05:46.090 --> 05:48.430
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

54
05:48.560 --> 05:49.980
♪ By your side ♪

55
05:50.000 --> 05:50.980
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

56
05:51.010 --> 05:53.360
♪ Feel warm again ♪

57
05:54.409 --> 05:56.810
♪ It's you ♪

58
06:26.250 --> 06:27.000
Feifei,

59
06:27.100 --> 06:28.750
since you're on field duty today,

60
06:28.750 --> 06:30.100
you can get off work early.

61
06:30.100 --> 06:31.330
Thanks, Mr. Qin.

62
06:31.390 --> 06:32.720
I'll take my leave then.

63
06:32.860 --> 06:33.800
See you next week, Mr. Qin.

64
06:33.800 --> 06:34.800
See you next week.

65
06:41.810 --> 06:42.430
Yun Li!

66
06:46.800 --> 06:47.659
Come over here.

67
06:55.450 --> 06:56.330
Mr. Qin.

68
06:58.240 --> 06:59.500
This is urgent.

69
06:59.630 --> 07:00.860
Help me sort out

70
07:01.040 --> 07:01.890
the player feedback

71
07:01.890 --> 07:03.300
from the experience center.

72
07:03.300 --> 07:04.980
I need them for tomorrow's meeting.

73
07:04.980 --> 07:07.190
You need so many of them sorted out today?

74
07:07.190 --> 07:09.660
The R&D department needs a large sample of data,

75
07:09.660 --> 07:10.800
and they need it urgently.

76
07:10.800 --> 07:12.200
Just work some overtime.

77
07:12.750 --> 07:13.930
Go for it, Yun Li.

78
07:17.830 --> 07:19.250
"Go for it, Yun Li."

79
07:20.240 --> 07:21.700
How could he even say that?

80
07:29.630 --> 07:30.430
You're back.

81
07:31.390 --> 07:33.070
It's pouring rain outside, isn't it?

82
07:33.070 --> 07:33.510
Dry yourself.

83
07:33.510 --> 07:34.070
Thanks.

84
07:35.310 --> 07:36.310
Everything about Nanwu is great,

85
07:36.310 --> 07:37.920
except for the frequent rain.

86
07:37.920 --> 07:38.870
That's just how Nanwu is,

87
07:38.870 --> 07:39.950
with endless rain.

88
07:39.950 --> 07:41.390
Hurry back to your room, take a hot shower,

89
07:41.390 --> 07:42.650
and get some good rest.

90
07:42.680 --> 07:43.360
Thank you.

91
07:46.360 --> 07:47.040
Good night.

92
07:53.600 --> 07:54.720
Fu Zhengchu.

93
07:58.190 --> 07:58.990
What's wrong?

94
07:59.270 --> 08:01.190
What happened between you and Tangy?

95
08:01.190 --> 08:02.040
What do you mean?

96
08:02.040 --> 08:02.950
What happened between us?

97
08:02.950 --> 08:04.150
Check the group chat.

98
08:04.600 --> 08:05.930
What on earth happened?

99
08:10.360 --> 08:11.160
Where's Lili?

100
08:12.270 --> 08:13.870
She's still not off work yet?

101
08:13.870 --> 08:14.560
Nope.

102
08:14.720 --> 08:16.480
If I can't afford to mess with her, I can at least hide.

103
08:16.480 --> 08:17.240
Fu Zhengchu!

104
08:18.950 --> 08:19.800
What's up?

105
08:20.430 --> 08:21.490
Give me your phone.

106
08:21.870 --> 08:22.560
What for?

107
08:22.720 --> 08:23.600
Your phone.

108
08:23.950 --> 08:24.390
Hurry!

109
08:25.870 --> 08:26.950
Tangy, your phone.

110
08:28.430 --> 08:29.510
What's this all about?

111
08:29.510 --> 08:30.950
You two, add each other

112
08:31.020 --> 08:32.909
on WeChat right now,

113
08:33.270 --> 08:35.870
so you won't bother me with every little thing.

114
08:37.080 --> 08:37.549
Done.

115
09:04.390 --> 09:05.200
Finished.

116
09:05.860 --> 09:06.750
Awesome, Yun Li,

117
09:06.750 --> 09:08.200
you finished all of them.

118
09:08.730 --> 09:10.010
Save, save...

119
09:14.770 --> 09:15.940
It's this late?

120
09:18.500 --> 09:19.440
The last bus...

121
09:19.720 --> 09:20.820
I won't make it.

122
09:59.590 --> 10:00.390
Wait a minute!

123
10:04.670 --> 10:05.580
Wait...

124
11:41.270 --> 11:43.270
It's 10 o'clock! The special offers start!

125
11:43.270 --> 11:45.840
-20% off for all the soon-to-expire items. -Wel...

126
11:45.840 --> 11:47.620
-Welcome... -Spend a little for a feast!

127
11:47.620 --> 11:49.010
Miss it, and you'll have to wait for tomorrow's.

128
11:49.010 --> 11:50.340
Come and grab a bargain!

129
12:10.310 --> 12:10.810
Hello.

130
12:18.170 --> 12:19.370
I didn't get this.

131
12:20.400 --> 12:21.410
It's a free gift.

132
12:21.890 --> 12:22.620
Thank you.

133
12:27.460 --> 12:28.360
Sorry,

134
12:28.390 --> 12:30.320
I didn't know you were at work today

135
12:30.390 --> 12:32.390
and didn't bring the umbrella over.

136
12:32.600 --> 12:34.240
It's okay. No rush.

137
12:36.790 --> 12:38.550
Did you just start working here?

138
12:38.550 --> 12:40.240
How come I haven't seen you before?

139
12:40.240 --> 12:41.300
Yeah, I'm new here.

140
12:42.630 --> 12:43.840
Then I'll return the umbrella

141
12:43.840 --> 12:45.130
to you next time I come.

142
12:45.700 --> 12:46.500
Deal.

143
12:46.960 --> 12:47.790
Do you want...

144
12:47.790 --> 12:48.750
No, thank you.

145
12:52.750 --> 12:54.060
To add me on WeChat...

146
13:15.200 --> 13:16.000
Lili,

147
13:16.290 --> 13:17.790
what time did you get home last night?

148
13:17.790 --> 13:19.550
Why didn't you reply to my messages again?

149
13:19.550 --> 13:21.100
I probably fell asleep.

150
13:21.840 --> 13:23.440
What's up with your voice?

151
13:23.670 --> 13:24.800
Did you catch a cold?

152
13:25.650 --> 13:26.790
Probably.

153
13:27.340 --> 13:28.720
Then you should get some good rest at home

154
13:28.720 --> 13:30.120
instead of going to work.

155
13:30.150 --> 13:31.860
I just started working, and I'm asking for leave?

156
13:31.860 --> 13:32.990
Is that really okay?

157
13:33.290 --> 13:35.490
I'll be fine after drinking more water.

158
13:35.960 --> 13:36.760
Where are you?

159
13:36.790 --> 13:38.390
I'll send you some medicine.

160
13:38.600 --> 13:40.130
I'm on my way.

161
13:40.150 --> 13:41.100
Almost there.

162
13:41.550 --> 13:43.210
Don't push yourself too hard.

163
13:43.440 --> 13:44.200
Tell me anytime

164
13:44.200 --> 13:45.400
if anything happens.

165
13:45.460 --> 13:46.250
I got it.

166
13:46.250 --> 13:47.650
I'll listen to you, boss.

167
13:48.100 --> 13:48.890
Bye-bye.

168
14:05.840 --> 14:07.970
If my skateboard doesn't arrive soon,

169
14:08.440 --> 14:10.440
running a marathon like this every day

170
14:10.440 --> 14:11.790
will kill me first.

171
14:24.770 --> 14:25.500
Hello?

172
14:26.150 --> 14:27.030
Where are you?

173
14:27.700 --> 14:28.740
What do you mean?

174
14:29.390 --> 14:30.230
I mean,

175
14:30.260 --> 14:32.190
where are you right now?

176
14:32.460 --> 14:34.530
I'm... in the classroom.

177
14:35.960 --> 14:36.790
Panting like that,

178
14:36.790 --> 14:38.290
you say you're in the classroom?

179
14:38.290 --> 14:39.100
Turn around.

180
14:39.500 --> 14:40.290
Turn around?

181
14:45.190 --> 14:45.980
Get on.

182
14:47.660 --> 14:48.420
Your bike doesn't have a rear seat.

183
14:48.420 --> 14:49.400
Where do I get on?

184
14:49.490 --> 14:50.320
Cut the crap.

185
14:50.600 --> 14:51.390
Get on.

186
14:51.550 --> 14:52.950
Or you'll really be late.

187
14:55.840 --> 14:57.370
When did you add a seat to it?

188
14:58.350 --> 14:59.310
None of your business.

189
14:59.310 --> 15:00.770
I put it on when I wanted to.

190
15:01.840 --> 15:03.770
I don't really want to know anyway.

191
15:17.770 --> 15:19.030
Yun Li, you have a cold?

192
15:22.240 --> 15:22.820
I'm fine.

193
15:22.820 --> 15:23.890
Drink some warm water, and I'll be fine.

194
15:23.890 --> 15:25.250
Then take care and get some good rest.

195
15:25.250 --> 15:26.230
Thank you, Qian.

196
15:52.930 --> 15:53.790
See you around.

197
15:53.930 --> 15:54.630
Bye-bye.

198
15:58.100 --> 16:00.810
Take 2 pills at a time.

199
16:05.360 --> 16:06.690
The materials are ready

200
16:06.710 --> 16:08.200
for your review, sir.

201
16:21.790 --> 16:23.000
That place offers really delicious food.

202
16:23.000 --> 16:23.820
I made a reservation

203
16:23.820 --> 16:25.870
right after you mentioned it last time.

204
16:25.870 --> 16:26.730
Okay, bye-bye.

205
16:27.200 --> 16:28.510
Yun Li, I'm off.

206
16:28.580 --> 16:29.960
-Bye-bye. -Bye-bye.

207
16:30.110 --> 16:31.160
I'm off. Bye-bye.

208
16:45.220 --> 16:47.170
You still haven't finished this yet?

209
16:47.170 --> 16:48.970
You're too inefficient, Yun Li.

210
16:49.800 --> 16:51.270
I only have one page to go.

211
16:51.290 --> 16:52.410
You still need

212
16:52.410 --> 16:54.270
to improve your work efficiency.

213
16:54.320 --> 16:56.550
You can't always do ineffective overtime.

214
16:56.550 --> 16:57.360
At this rate,

215
16:57.770 --> 16:59.370
how can I approve your overtime pay?

216
16:59.370 --> 16:59.960
I...

217
16:59.960 --> 17:00.460
Mr. Qin,

218
17:00.460 --> 17:02.790
I don't think I asked for any overtime pay.

219
17:03.580 --> 17:04.250
I forgot

220
17:04.250 --> 17:05.180
that interns

221
17:05.380 --> 17:07.180
don't have overtime pay anyway.

222
17:08.569 --> 17:10.180
But I like your attitude.

223
17:10.460 --> 17:12.160
You're surely going to get

224
17:12.160 --> 17:13.349
the only regular position.

225
17:13.349 --> 17:14.140
Do your best.

226
17:34.980 --> 17:35.810
It's done.

227
17:44.180 --> 17:45.270
Well, Mr. Qin.

228
17:46.110 --> 17:46.980
I've wrapped it up.

229
17:46.980 --> 17:47.980
I'm leaving them here.

230
17:47.980 --> 17:48.880
I'm getting off work now.

231
17:48.880 --> 17:49.680
Hold on.

232
17:50.270 --> 17:51.510
This batch of purchase orders

233
17:51.510 --> 17:53.380
needs to be sorted out and entered into the system again.

234
17:53.380 --> 17:54.840
Get it done for me tonight.

235
17:56.190 --> 17:58.400
Do they have to be submitted tonight?

236
17:58.460 --> 18:00.250
We're in urgent need of them for tomorrow's meeting.

237
18:00.250 --> 18:01.910
I have no other choice either.

238
18:03.220 --> 18:04.080
How about this?

239
18:04.610 --> 18:05.610
I'll stay here with you.

240
18:05.610 --> 18:07.610
Give them to me whenever you finish.

241
18:10.460 --> 18:11.390
Get back to work.

242
18:46.380 --> 18:47.180
Never mind,

243
18:47.350 --> 18:49.950
at least he's willing to work overtime with me.

244
19:40.770 --> 19:41.400
No way.

245
19:41.830 --> 19:43.430
I can't just put up with this.

246
19:56.380 --> 19:57.200
Is it fun?

247
20:00.090 --> 20:01.750
Aren't you going to continue?

248
20:02.180 --> 20:02.980
Fu,

249
20:03.240 --> 20:04.270
we're on the same team.

250
20:04.270 --> 20:05.270
Cut me some slack.

251
20:06.090 --> 20:07.820
Which group should I send it to?

252
20:12.270 --> 20:13.180
Mr. Qin,

253
20:14.630 --> 20:16.720
I need to talk to you.

254
20:19.740 --> 20:20.530
Go ahead.

255
20:21.380 --> 20:22.050
I think

256
20:22.050 --> 20:23.380
the work you assigned me today

257
20:23.380 --> 20:24.640
is very unreasonable.

258
20:24.790 --> 20:25.980
This work doesn't have

259
20:25.980 --> 20:27.400
to be completed today.

260
20:27.930 --> 20:29.570
You said you'd stay late with me,

261
20:29.570 --> 20:30.830
and I thought you needed

262
20:30.830 --> 20:31.570
the purchase materials urgently,

263
20:31.570 --> 20:33.200
but you turned out to be playing games.

264
20:33.200 --> 20:34.290
In the end, I got it done

265
20:34.290 --> 20:35.330
all by myself.

266
20:36.940 --> 20:37.860
Yun Li!

267
20:38.440 --> 20:39.240
I was just trying

268
20:39.240 --> 20:40.940
to give you more opportunities!

269
20:40.940 --> 20:41.500
You've

270
20:41.500 --> 20:42.480
forced work onto me

271
20:42.480 --> 20:43.960
that I'm not responsible for.

272
20:43.960 --> 20:44.720
You young people

273
20:44.720 --> 20:46.660
shouldn't always make a big deal out of everything.

274
20:46.660 --> 20:48.940
Everyone has been through this.

275
20:56.350 --> 20:57.160
Forget it.

276
20:57.380 --> 20:58.510
You can get off work.

277
20:58.610 --> 20:59.940
I'll do the rest myself.

278
21:03.400 --> 21:04.400
Take your things.

279
21:15.850 --> 21:16.510
Fu Shize.

280
21:17.880 --> 21:18.720
Thank you.

281
21:19.850 --> 21:20.850
Thank me for what?

282
21:21.490 --> 21:23.270
Thank you for helping me out.

283
21:24.320 --> 21:25.570
Thankfully, you were there with me.

284
21:25.570 --> 21:26.270
I just

285
21:26.270 --> 21:28.070
blurted it all out back there...

286
21:30.250 --> 21:31.720
If I have to say it again now,

287
21:31.720 --> 21:33.250
I'll definitely stutter.

288
21:37.140 --> 21:39.600
Weren't you off work already?

289
21:39.680 --> 21:41.810
What made you come back all of a sudden?

290
21:42.530 --> 21:43.420
Xia said it was so late,

291
21:43.420 --> 21:44.460
and you hadn't returned yet.

292
21:44.460 --> 21:45.520
She was so worried.

293
21:46.050 --> 21:47.480
I'll text Xia.

294
21:50.310 --> 21:52.180
M-My phone is dead.

295
21:52.350 --> 21:53.070
Can you help me

296
21:53.070 --> 21:54.510
tell Xia?

297
21:54.610 --> 21:55.420
Tell her what?

298
21:56.240 --> 21:58.370
Just tell her we are already together.

299
22:05.350 --> 22:07.350
I mean we have already...

300
22:08.420 --> 22:10.550
m-met up.

301
22:16.160 --> 22:17.400
Yun Li was working overtime in the office.

302
22:17.400 --> 22:18.070
She's fine.

303
22:18.250 --> 22:19.910
Let's go. I'll give you a ride.

304
22:26.700 --> 22:29.310
I want to go for a walk. May I?

305
22:31.090 --> 22:32.420
Are you feeling better?

306
22:33.350 --> 22:34.310
Much better.

307
22:34.830 --> 22:35.250
Mm.

308
22:44.270 --> 22:45.470
This looks so pretty.

309
23:01.920 --> 23:02.960
Hey, welcome!

310
23:02.990 --> 23:04.850
See if there's anything you like.

311
23:08.720 --> 23:09.980
Hold on, hold on, miss.

312
23:13.510 --> 23:14.370
Check this out.

313
23:14.500 --> 23:15.660
Here are our little fairy sparklers,

314
23:15.660 --> 23:17.860
which suit fairies like you perfectly.

315
23:21.920 --> 23:22.750
No, thank you.

316
23:22.960 --> 23:23.920
We want a box.

317
23:23.920 --> 23:24.660
Okay.

318
23:31.820 --> 23:32.450
Paid.

319
23:32.470 --> 23:33.400
Okay, thank you.

320
23:38.440 --> 23:39.010
Hey there,

321
23:39.010 --> 23:40.270
see if there's anything you like.

322
23:40.270 --> 23:42.070
We offer all sorts of items here.

323
23:44.090 --> 23:46.480
During one Mid-Autumn Festival when I was a kid,

324
23:46.480 --> 23:48.350
I spent all my savings

325
23:48.350 --> 23:49.380
buying plenty of fireworks

326
23:49.380 --> 23:50.840
to set off with my brother.

327
23:50.940 --> 23:51.750
But they ended up being

328
23:51.750 --> 23:53.740
confiscated by the city inspectors.

329
23:53.740 --> 23:56.400
It was indeed not very safe to set off fireworks.

330
23:58.090 --> 23:59.630
Can we light them here?

331
24:01.010 --> 24:01.500
Mm.

332
24:08.010 --> 24:08.810
Come closer.

333
24:21.250 --> 24:24.060
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

334
24:22.200 --> 24:23.330
I mean the sparkler.

335
24:24.820 --> 24:27.470
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

336
24:28.270 --> 24:30.680
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

337
24:30.700 --> 24:33.900
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

338
24:34.810 --> 24:37.900
