462
30:40.980 --> 30:42.570
and sent me back.

463
30:42.570 --> 30:43.660
Not bad!

464
30:43.960 --> 30:45.220
What a rich itinerary!

465
30:48.660 --> 30:50.010
So you came back so late

466
30:50.010 --> 30:51.460
