479
31:10.720 --> 31:11.750
Just friends?

480
31:13.320 --> 31:15.300
I've already made great strides.

481
31:15.320 --> 31:17.520
At least he no longer sees me as a junior.

482
31:17.590 --> 31:18.400
I'm already happy

483
31:18.400 --> 31:20.350
being friends with him.

484
31:20.510 --> 31:22.550
You're happy with so little!

485
31:23.500 --> 31:26.200
There's a whole galaxy

486
31:26.310 --> 31:28.640
