487
31:31.010 --> 31:33.260
I've already done a 100-meter sprint.

488
31:33.290 --> 31:35.400
I should at least be allowed to catch my breath.

489
31:35.400 --> 31:36.250
No way.

490
31:36.920 --> 31:38.290
You're at the starting line now,

491
31:38.290 --> 31:39.720
