496
31:50.750 --> 31:52.460
Should I court him then?

497
31:52.500 --> 31:53.460
Yes, of course.

498
31:53.590 --> 31:54.720
You must pursue him.

499
31:55.180 --> 31:57.440
You're pursuing this moon in your heart.

500
31:58.330 --> 32:00.400
