505
32:09.500 --> 32:10.200
Forget it.

506
32:10.200 --> 32:11.590
I'm not going to embarrass myself.

507
32:11.590 --> 32:13.530
I'm happy just being friends with him.

508
32:13.530 --> 32:15.060
